<li>reject malformed or incomplete specs.</li>
<li>reject unknown judge/gate ids.</li>
<li>reject duplicate ids.</li>
<li>reject placeholder/non-hex hashes.</li>
<li>canonicalize spec and compute ContractRoot from the actual complete byt=
