<p>Do not use Date.now()/random labels as evidence identity.</p>
<p>Replay must recompute all derivable hashes and fail closed.</p>
<ol>
<li>FRESHNESS MUST BE STRICT</li>
</ol>
<p>Current replay does:</p>

<code>const maxAge =3D spec.freshness[e.class] || 3600
</code>
<p>Unknown evidence classes silently receive a one-hour policy. That allows=
