<p>Required:</p>
<ul>
<li>evidence class absent from spec freshness/provenance policy -&gt; rejec=
t.</li>
<li>invalid observed_at -&gt; reject.</li>
<li>evidence from the future beyond clock-skew tolerance -&gt; reject.</li>
