<p>UNKNOWN is for unavailable/ambiguous world information. Malformed eviden=
ce is not a factual FALSE; it is invalid proof input.</p>
<ol>
<li>CLAIM MUST BE BOUND TO CONTRACTROOT</li>
</ol>
<p>replayReceipt verifies receipt.contract_root and receipt.claim_id, but d=
