<p>Add it.</p>
<p>Also validate the claim subject against the proof spec=E2=80=99s claim s=
chema. No generic Record&lt;string,string&gt; should bypass schema.</p>
<ol>
<li>JUDGE AND GATE RESULT ROOTS MUST COMMIT TO FULL RESULTS</li>
